Scale-separated induction audit for LRC
==============================================================================
Lemma audited: if A is the seed safe set at threshold 1/n,
  mu(A cap Safe_v) >= (1-2/n)mu(A) - 2*components(A)/v.
Thus adding a sufficiently large speed reduces LRC(n) to a smaller
seed problem, but the sufficient threshold depends on the seed's
component budget, not only on n.

